>Have I forgotten something in the VMS 6.1 installation?

Just a hunch - we have seen this from time to time.  Do you have MOTIF V1.2
installed on the VMS system?  If so, you want to get a patch for the VXT
software (I think you want V2.1D).  MOTIF V1.2 changed some of the
authorization stuff.  You can either set the VXT security to allow the
connections by username and host or you can open up all connections to the VXT
as a way around this (not very secure though).

